DSH adaptations exist in two places:
- vendored sources carry port adaptations (OpenClaw SDK shims in
  vendor/openclaw-lark/src/core/dsh-compat.ts and friends, removal of the
  single-owner policy for the DSH multi-identity model) plus local patches;
  all post-import patches are inventoried in
  vendor/openclaw-lark/LOCAL_PATCHES.txt and documented in docs/VENDORING.md;
- DSH session orchestration and native tool registration live in src/.
